      "title": "Cascade Power & Light 2026 Integrated Resource Plan",
      "summary": "A fictional utility's IRP filing. Every value in this record is invented.",
      "description": "Cascade Power & Light is not a real utility and UE-26-0142 is not a real docket. The record exists so the registry's shapes have something complete to validate against, and so the demo can show a filing whose every number is traceable without attributing an invented assessment to a real company. The network it binds is not invented: it is the published Great Britain reference model, which is the arrangement worth showing \u2014 a study is a set of choices laid over a network somebody else can download and check, and only the choices here are fictional.",
